# Windows 11 29H1 Icons Directory
# Placeholder for custom 29H1 system icons

# This directory should contain:
# - computer.ico (This PC icon)
# - recyclebin.ico (Empty recycle bin)
# - recyclebin_full.ico (Full recycle bin)
# - network.ico (Network icon)
# - printer.ico (Printer icon)
# - documents.ico (Documents folder)
# - pictures.ico (Pictures folder)
# - music.ico (Music folder)
# - videos.ico (Videos folder)
# - downloads.ico (Downloads folder)
# - desktop.ico (Desktop icon)

# All icons should be in .ico format with multiple sizes (16x16, 32x32, 48x48, 256x256)
# Use 32-bit color depth with transparency where appropriate
